  "description": "You can't argue with meat on a stick. Especially if it's wrapped in bacon. On top of that kabobs happen to be one of the best items to grill as a group. They get everyone around the grill, cooking their own food, and are done quickly. Perfect for your upcoming Fourth of July cookout.",
